,"t":"(with) destruction","p":"N","tr":"tatbīran","f":["VN","(II)","M","INDEF","ACC"],"r":737,"l":2683},{"e":"٧","v":"17:7"}]}],"verses":[{"k":"17:1","t":"Exalted is He who took His Servant [i.e., Prophet Muḥammad (ﷺ)] by night from al-Masjid al-Ḥarām to al-Masjid al-Aqṣā, whose surroundings We have blessed, to show him of Our signs. Indeed, He is the Hearing, the Seeing.","j":15,"h":29,"s":17,"a":1,"sd":null},{"k":"17:2","t":"And We gave Moses the Scripture and made it a guidance for the Children of Israel that you not take other than Me as Disposer of affairs,","j":15,"h":29,"s":17,"a":2,"sd":null},{"k":"17:3","t":"O descendants of those We carried [in the ship] with Noah. Indeed, he was a grateful servant.","j":15,"h":29,"s":17,"a":3,"sd":null},{"k":"17:4","t":"And We conveyed to the Children of Israel in the Scripture that, \"You will surely cause corruption on the earth twice, and you will surely reach [a degree of] great haughtiness.\"","j":15,"h":29,"s":17,"a":4,"sd":null},{"k":"17:5","t":"So when the [time of] promise came for the first of them, We sent against you servants of Ours - those of great military might, and they probed [even] into the homes, and it was a promise fulfilled.","j":15,"h":29,"s":17,"a":5,"sd":null},{"k":"17:6","t":"Then We gave back to you a return victory over them. And We reinforced you with wealth and sons and made you more numerous in manpower.","j":15,"h":29,"s":17,"a":6,"sd":null},{"k":"17:7","t":"[And said], \"If you do good, you do good for yourselves; and if you do evil, [you do it] to them [i.e., yourselves].\" Then when the final [i.e., second] promise came, [We sent your enemies] to sadden your faces and to enter the masjid [i.e., the temple in Jerusalem], as they entered it the first time, and to destroy what they had taken over with [total] destruction.","j":15,"h":29,"s":17,"a":7,"sd":null}],"juz":15,"hizb":29,"surahs":[17],"sajdah":false}